			"notes": "0.0.5-B — Full Changelog\nNew Machines\nAdded Oil Derrick.\nExtracts Crude Oil and Natural Gas from underground oil deposits.\nUses drilling pipes while drilling downward.\nSupports machine upgrades.\nIncludes its original-style multiblock structure, GUI, model, textures and crafting recipe.\nAdded Industrial Mixer.\nAdded processing recipes.\nAdded fluid processing.\nAdded GUI and JEI integration.\nAdded original-style model and textures.\nAdded Arc Welder.\nAdded Arc Welder processing recipes.\nAdded Graphite Electrodes.\nAdded welded metal plates.\nAdded GUI and JEI integration.\nAdded original-style model and textures.\nAdded Air Intake.\nAdded operating animation and sound.\nAdded required crafting components and recipe.\nAdded 10k–20Hz Transformer.\nOil System\nAdded underground Oil Deposits.\nAdded Depleted Oil Deposits.\nAdded Bedrock Oil Deposits.\nAdded oil world generation.\nAdded Oil Derrick drill pipes.\nOil deposits can be depleted through extraction.\nAdded Crude Oil extraction.\nAdded Natural Gas extraction.\nAdded original-style hazardous drilling interactions with certain underground materials.\nOil Reservoir Detector\nAdded Oil Reservoir Detector.\nAdded its original crafting recipe.\nAdded original detector sound.\nAdded original-style detector chat messages.\nDetects:\nOil directly below.\nBedrock oil directly below.\nNearby oil.\nNearby bedrock oil.\nNo nearby oil.\nNew Items & Materials\nAdded Titanium Drill.\nAdded Graphite Electrode.\nAdded Steel Tank.\nAdded Dense Copper Wire.\nAdded Dense Gold Wire.\nAdded Dense Mingrade Wire.\nAdded Welded Iron Plate.\nAdded Welded Steel Plate.\nAdded Welded Copper Plate.\nAdded Welded Titanium Plate.\nAdded Welded Aluminium Plate.\nAdded Welded Tungsten Plate.\nAdded additional machine components required by newly ported machines.\nNew Blocks\nAdded Steel Beam.\nAdded Steel Grate.\nAdded oil-related underground blocks.\nAdded drilling-related blocks used by the Oil Derrick.\nFluid Containers\nReworked portable fluid-container handling.\nEmpty containers now display:\n0 / MAX mB\nRemoved broken %s placeholders from fluid-container names.\nPortable containers now use full-container transfers.\nA container is only filled when enough fluid is available to fill it completely.\nA filled container is only emptied when the destination can accept its complete contents.\nImproved automatic stacking of empty containers.\nImproved automatic stacking of filled containers containing the same fluid.\nImproved automatic handling of fluid containers by machines.\nImproved handling of buckets and cells in machine input/output slots.\nImproved fluid-network compatibility with storage blocks.\nChemical Plant\nImproved recipe ingredient validation.\nItem slots now accept appropriate ingredients instead of unrelated items.\nFluid inputs now better respect the selected/available recipe.\nImproved automatic fluid-container handling.\nStorage Crates\nStorage Crates now preserve their inventory when broken.\nPlacing the crate restores its stored inventory.\nEmpty crates can stack.\nCrates containing items remain non-stackable.\nAdded comparator output based on crate contents.\nPrevented filled crates from being nested inside other crates.\nSoldering Station\nImproved Soldering Station recipe visualization.\nImproved displayed crafting-result positioning.\nImproved soldering visual effects.\nImproved JEI presentation.\nImproved upgrade handling consistency with the original behavior.\nAssembly Machine\nImproved GUI layout.\nImproved result-slot positioning.\nImproved progress-arrow rendering.\nShredder\nCorrected electricity/progress visualization direction.\nImproved JEI presentation.\nCrucible\nImproved animated progress visualization.\nFoundry\nImproved Foundry rendering.\nImproved casting presentation.\nImproved Foundry JEI integration.\nImproved fluid visualization in Foundry-related interfaces.\nBattery Socket\nImproved inventory model positioning.\nImproved JEI presentation.\nWood Burning Generator\nImproved inventory model scale and centering.\nMachine Press\n\n..."
		},
