			"notes": "HBM NTM: Unofficial NeoForge Edition 0.0.4-A\nAdded\nAdded the Foundry system.\nAdded Crucible with molten metal processing and casting.\nAdded Foundry Molds, Channels, Outlets, Slag Taps, Basins and Tanks.\nAdded multiple casting molds and castable parts.\nAdded Firebox and Heating Oven.\nAdded Soldering Station.\nAdded Iron Crate and Steel Crate.\nAdded QE Containment Door.\nAdded configurable door access modes using the Screwdriver.\nAdded Gas Mask, M65-Z Gas Mask, Leather Gas Mask and Half Mask.\nAdded Gas Mask Filters and filter installation/removal.\nAdded gas mask overlays.\nAdded Hemp with world generation and growth.\nAdded Fat Man assembly and activation.\nAdded nuclear explosion visual effects based on the original Torex system.\nAdded the NTM Missiles and Satellites creative tab.\nAdded Satellite ID Chip.\nAdded Depth-Resource Scanning Satellite as WIP content.\nAdded Soyuz-FG as WIP content.\nAdded new machine recipes, crafting recipes and JEI integration for the newly added content.\nChanged\nExpanded industrial machine content and progression.\nImproved creative tab organization.\nAdded more original HBM models, textures, sounds and GUIs.\nExpanded heat, casting and machine interaction systems.\nAdded radiation shielding behavior to the QE Containment Door.\nAdded redstone support and access modes to supported doors.\nImproved compatibility between machines, electricity, heat and fluid systems.\nWIP\nFat Man currently has visual explosion effects only.\nTerrain destruction and full nuclear weapon behavior are not implemented yet.\nSatellite and Soyuz-FG content is currently WIP."
		},
